<title>PHILIPPINES: Greater Asia to buy into resort firm.</title>
<headline>Greater Asia to buy into resort firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greater Asia Resources Corp said on Monday it is looking at the possibility of acquiring 70 percent stake in Akean Resorts Inc, a local firm.</p>
<p>Greater Asia president Antonio Gatmaitan said the purchase would be through swapping of shares. Greater Asia is planning to exchange its shares which will be taken out from its proposed capital increase.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
